  "description": "Elevate your little one’s first pedal bike adventure with Koda Plus. With a lightweight aluminum frame and kid-specific ergonomics, this kids bike was designed for effortless handling, even for the smallest of explorers. Speaking of small, the seat’s low minimum height of 16\" is perfect for younger riders and adjusts to keep them riding comfortably through their growth spurts. We’ve also added internal cable routing for a sleek look and fully aluminum brake levers for extra durability. EasySafe front and rear V-brakes offer safe and reliable stopping power, and the rust-free aluminum brake levers adjust without tools to ensure optimal grip and control for little hands. With comfort features they’ll love and safety features that keep nervous parents at ease, Koda Plus is ready to take your little one from their first ride to countless adventures ahead.",
